{"id":"bfa8d47011a89087","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/643_区间时序逻辑_ITL.md","title":"643 区间时序逻辑 ITL","display":"643_区间时序逻辑_ITL","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-符号表\">1. 符号表</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span>。原始构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom},\\bot,\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{chop},\\operatorname{skip},\\operatorname{star}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atom},\\bot,\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{chop},\\operatorname{skip},\\operatorname{star}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>显示为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A;B\">\\(A;B\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{skip}\">\\(\\mathsf{skip}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A^*\">\\(A^*\\)</span>。派生记号为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\top=(\\bot\\to\\bot),\\quad\nA\\land B=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\quad\nA\\lor B=\\neg A\\to B,\\quad\nA\\leftrightarrow B=(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\top=(\\bot\\to\\bot),\\quad\nA\\land B=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\quad\nA\\lor B=\\neg A\\to B,\\quad\nA\\leftrightarrow B=(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"2.-公式\">2. 公式</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{643}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{643}\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{643}\">\\(\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{643}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{643}\">\\(\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{643}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{skip}\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{643}\">\\(\\mathsf{skip}\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{643}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{643}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{643}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{643}\">\\(\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{643}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{643}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{643}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{643}\">\\(A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{643}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{643}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{643}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A;B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{643}\">\\(A;B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{643}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{643}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{643}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A^*\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{643}\">\\(A^*\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{643}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"3.-自由变元\">3. 自由变元</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{643}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{643}(\\bot)=\\operatorname{FV}_{643}(\\mathsf{skip})=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{643}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{643}(\\bot)=\\operatorname{FV}_{643}(\\mathsf{skip})=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{643}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{643}(A),\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{643}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{643}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{643}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{643}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{643}(A),\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{643}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{643}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{643}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{643}(A;B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{643}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{643}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{643}(A;B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{643}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{643}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{643}(A^*)=\\operatorname{FV}_{643}(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{643}(A^*)=\\operatorname{FV}_{643}(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{643}(A)=\\varnothing\">\\(\\operatorname{BV}_{643}(A)=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"4.-命题替换\">4. 命题替换</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Subst}_{643}\">\\(\\mathsf{Subst}_{643}\\)</span> 为有限支撑函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{643}\">\\(\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{643}\\)</span> 的集合，其中</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{supp}_{643}(\\sigma)=\\{p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}:\\sigma(p)\\ne\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{supp}_{643}(\\sigma)=\\{p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}:\\sigma(p)\\ne\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>是有限集。每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{643}\">\\(\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{643}\\)</span> 唯一扩张为类型化函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma_{643}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{643}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{643}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma_{643}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{643}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{643}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并满足：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma_{643}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma_{643}(\\bot)=\\bot,\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma_{643}(\\mathsf{skip})=\\mathsf{skip},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma_{643}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma_{643}(\\bot)=\\bot,\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma_{643}(\\mathsf{skip})=\\mathsf{skip},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma_{643}(\\neg A)=\\neg\\widehat\\sigma_{643}(A),\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma_{643}(A\\to B)=\\widehat\\sigma_{643}(A)\\to\\widehat\\sigma_{643}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma_{643}(\\neg A)=\\neg\\widehat\\sigma_{643}(A),\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma_{643}(A\\to B)=\\widehat\\sigma_{643}(A)\\to\\widehat\\sigma_{643}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma_{643}(A;B)=\\widehat\\sigma_{643}(A);\\widehat\\sigma_{643}(B),\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma_{643}(A^*)=(\\widehat\\sigma_{643}(A))^*.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma_{643}(A;B)=\\widehat\\sigma_{643}(A);\\widehat\\sigma_{643}(B),\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma_{643}(A^*)=(\\widehat\\sigma_{643}(A))^*.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\equiv_{\\alpha,643}B\">\\(A\\equiv_{\\alpha,643}B\\)</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=B\">\\(A=B\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"5.-公理集合\">5. 公理集合</h1>\n<p>命题公理三族定义为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{643}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{643}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{643}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{643}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{643}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{643}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{643}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{643}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{643}=\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{643}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{643}=\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{643}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>区间 chop 公理族：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{Assoc}^{643}=\\{(A;(B;C))\\leftrightarrow((A;B);C):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{643}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{Assoc}^{643}=\\{(A;(B;C))\\leftrightarrow((A;B);C):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{643}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{SkipL}^{643}=\\{\\mathsf{skip};A\\leftrightarrow A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{643}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{SkipL}^{643}=\\{\\mathsf{skip};A\\leftrightarrow A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{643}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{SkipR}^{643}=\\{A;\\mathsf{skip}\\leftrightarrow A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{643}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{SkipR}^{643}=\\{A;\\mathsf{skip}\\leftrightarrow A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{643}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{Star}^{643}=\\{A^*\\leftrightarrow(\\mathsf{skip}\\lor(A;A^*)):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{643}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{Star}^{643}=\\{A^*\\leftrightarrow(\\mathsf{skip}\\lor(A;A^*)):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{643}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>总公理集合：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{643}=\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{643}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{643}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{643}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Assoc}^{643}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{SkipL}^{643}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{SkipR}^{643}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Star}^{643}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{643}=\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{643}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{643}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{643}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Assoc}^{643}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{SkipL}^{643}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{SkipR}^{643}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Star}^{643}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-推理规则关系\">6. 推理规则关系</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{643}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{643}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{643}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{643}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{ChopEq}^{643}=\\{((A\\leftrightarrow C,B\\leftrightarrow D),(A;B)\\leftrightarrow(C;D)):A,B,C,D\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{643}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{ChopEq}^{643}=\\{((A\\leftrightarrow C,B\\leftrightarrow D),(A;B)\\leftrightarrow(C;D)):A,B,C,D\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{643}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{StarInd}^{643}\n=\n\\{(((\\mathsf{skip}\\lor(A;B))\\to B),A^*\\to B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{643}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{StarInd}^{643}\n=\n\\{(((\\mathsf{skip}\\lor(A;B))\\to B),A^*\\to B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{643}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{643}\n=\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{643}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{ChopEq}^{643}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{StarInd}^{643}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{643}\n=\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{643}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{ChopEq}^{643}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{StarInd}^{643}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"7.-证明对象\">7. 证明对象</h1>\n<p>定义证明对象函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Proof}_{643}:\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Frm}_{643})\n\\longrightarrow\n\\mathcal P\\!\\left(\\bigcup_{m&gt;0}\\mathsf{Frm}_{643}^{\\,m}\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Proof}_{643}:\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Frm}_{643})\n\\longrightarrow\n\\mathcal P\\!\\left(\\bigcup_{m&gt;0}\\mathsf{Frm}_{643}^{\\,m}\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{643}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{643}\\)</span>。证明是非空有限序列</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\pi=(A_0,\\ldots,A_{m-1})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\pi=(A_0,\\ldots,A_{m-1})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>满足每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{643}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{643}\\)</span>，且每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;m\">\\(i&lt;m\\)</span> 满足下列条件之一：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\Gamma\">\\(A_i\\in\\Gamma\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{643}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{643}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_k=A_j\\to A_i\">\\(A_k=A_j\\to A_i\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B,C,D\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{643}\">\\(A,B,C,D\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{643}\\)</span>，使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_j=A\\leftrightarrow C\">\\(A_j=A\\leftrightarrow C\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_k=B\\leftrightarrow D\">\\(A_k=B\\leftrightarrow D\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i=(A;B)\\leftrightarrow(C;D)\">\\(A_i=(A;B)\\leftrightarrow(C;D)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{643}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{643}\\)</span>，使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_j=(\\mathsf{skip}\\lor(A;B))\\to B\">\\(A_j=(\\mathsf{skip}\\lor(A;B))\\to B\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i=A^*\\to B\">\\(A_i=A^*\\to B\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>因此上述五条唯一确定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Proof}_{643}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\mathsf{Proof}_{643}(\\Gamma)\\)</span>。若还指定结论 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>，定义其纤维</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Proof}_{643}(\\Gamma,A)=\n\\{(A_0,\\ldots,A_{m-1})\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{643}(\\Gamma):A_{m-1}=A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Proof}_{643}(\\Gamma,A)=\n\\{(A_0,\\ldots,A_{m-1})\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{643}(\\Gamma):A_{m-1}=A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"8.-可证性\">8. 可证性</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{643}A\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{643}A\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当存在从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span> 出发的证明 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi=(A_0,\\ldots,A_{m-1})\">\\(\\pi=(A_0,\\ldots,A_{m-1})\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_{m-1}=A\">\\(A_{m-1}=A\\)</span>。</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Thm}_{643}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{643}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{643}A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Thm}_{643}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{643}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{643}A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"9.-目标区分\">9. 目标区分</h1>\n<p>ITL 的目标差异是 chop 构造子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A;B\">\\(A;B\\)</span> 与迭代 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A^*\">\\(A^*\\)</span>，它们直接形成公式并有结合、单位和迭代公理。</p>\n<h1 id=\"10.-区间结构\">10. 区间结构</h1>\n<p>定义离散区间集合：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Intv}_{643}\n=\n\\{(i,j):i,j\\in\\mathbb N,\\ i\\le j\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Intv}_{643}\n=\n\\{(i,j):i,j\\in\\mathbb N,\\ i\\le j\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义区间估值：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{IVal}_{643}\n=\n\\{V:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Intv}_{643})\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{IVal}_{643}\n=\n\\{V:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Intv}_{643})\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I=(i,j)\">\\(I=(i,j)\\)</span>，定义端点函数：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{lb}_{643}(I)=i,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{rb}_{643}(I)=j.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{lb}_{643}(I)=i,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{rb}_{643}(I)=j.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义区间拼接谓词：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Split}_{643}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Intv}_{643}^{\\,3}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Split}_{643}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Intv}_{643}^{\\,3}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Split}_{643}(I,K,L)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Split}_{643}(I,K,L)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(m\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> 使得</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"I=(i,j),\\quad K=(i,m),\\quad L=(m,j),\\quad i\\le m\\le j.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[I=(i,j),\\quad K=(i,m),\\quad L=(m,j),\\quad i\\le m\\le j.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义长度为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 的有限区间分割对象：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Part}_{643}\n\\subseteq\n\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\n\\left(\\mathsf{Intv}_{643}\\times\\{n\\}\\times\\mathbb N^{\\{0,\\ldots,n\\}}\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Part}_{643}\n\\subseteq\n\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\n\\left(\\mathsf{Intv}_{643}\\times\\{n\\}\\times\\mathbb N^{\\{0,\\ldots,n\\}}\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Part}_{643}(I,n,t)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Part}_{643}(I,n,t)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t:\\{0,\\ldots,n\\}\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(t:\\{0,\\ldots,n\\}\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t(0)=\\operatorname{lb}_{643}(I)\">\\(t(0)=\\operatorname{lb}_{643}(I)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t(n)=\\operatorname{rb}_{643}(I)\">\\(t(n)=\\operatorname{rb}_{643}(I)\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall r&lt;n\\ t(r)\\le t(r+1)\">\\(\\forall r&lt;n\\ t(r)\\le t(r+1)\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"11.-满足关系\">11. 满足关系</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Vdash_{643}\\subseteq\\mathsf{IVal}_{643}\\times\\mathsf{Intv}_{643}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{643}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Vdash_{643}\\subseteq\\mathsf{IVal}_{643}\\times\\mathsf{Intv}_{643}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{643}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>为满足下列递归子句的最小关系。</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"V,I\\Vdash_{643}\\operatorname{atom}(p)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nI\\in V(p).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[V,I\\Vdash_{643}\\operatorname{atom}(p)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nI\\in V(p).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"V,I\\not\\Vdash_{643}\\bot.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[V,I\\not\\Vdash_{643}\\bot.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"V,I\\Vdash_{643}\\mathsf{skip}\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{lb}_{643}(I)=\\operatorname{rb}_{643}(I).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[V,I\\Vdash_{643}\\mathsf{skip}\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{lb}_{643}(I)=\\operatorname{rb}_{643}(I).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"V,I\\Vdash_{643}\\neg A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nV,I\\not\\Vdash_{643}A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[V,I\\Vdash_{643}\\neg A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nV,I\\not\\Vdash_{643}A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"V,I\\Vdash_{643}A\\to B\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nV,I\\not\\Vdash_{643}A\\ \\text{或}\\ V,I\\Vdash_{643}B.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[V,I\\Vdash_{643}A\\to B\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nV,I\\not\\Vdash_{643}A\\ \\text{或}\\ V,I\\Vdash_{643}B.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"V,I\\Vdash_{643}A;B\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists K,L\\in\\mathsf{Intv}_{643}\\,\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{Split}_{643}(I,K,L)\\wedge V,K\\Vdash_{643}A\\wedge V,L\\Vdash_{643}B\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[V,I\\Vdash_{643}A;B\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists K,L\\in\\mathsf{Intv}_{643}\\,\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{Split}_{643}(I,K,L)\\wedge V,K\\Vdash_{643}A\\wedge V,L\\Vdash_{643}B\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"V,I\\Vdash_{643}A^*\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists t:\\{0,\\ldots,n\\}\\to\\mathbb N\\,\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{Part}_{643}(I,n,t)\\wedge\n\\forall r&lt;n\\ (t(r)\\le t(r+1)\\wedge V,(t(r),t(r+1))\\Vdash_{643}A)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[V,I\\Vdash_{643}A^*\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists t:\\{0,\\ldots,n\\}\\to\\mathbb N\\,\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{Part}_{643}(I,n,t)\\wedge\n\\forall r&lt;n\\ (t(r)\\le t(r+1)\\wedge V,(t(r),t(r+1))\\Vdash_{643}A)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"12.-语义后果\">12. 语义后果</h1>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{643}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{643}\\)</span>，定义：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\models_{643}A\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\models_{643}A\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\\in\\mathsf{IVal}_{643}\">\\(V\\in\\mathsf{IVal}_{643}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\in\\mathsf{Intv}_{643}\">\\(I\\in\\mathsf{Intv}_{643}\\)</span>，</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bigl(\\forall B\\in\\Gamma\\ V,I\\Vdash_{643}B\\bigr)\n\\Longrightarrow\nV,I\\Vdash_{643}A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bigl(\\forall B\\in\\Gamma\\ V,I\\Vdash_{643}B\\bigr)\n\\Longrightarrow\nV,I\\Vdash_{643}A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Val}_{643}\n=\n\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{643}:\\varnothing\\models_{643}A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Val}_{643}\n=\n\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{643}:\\varnothing\\models_{643}A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"13.-整个形式系统\">13. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{ITL}_{643}=(\\mathsf{Prop},\\mathsf{Frm}_{643},\\operatorname{FV}_{643},\\operatorname{BV}_{643},\\mathsf{Subst}_{643},\\widehat\\sigma_{643},\\equiv_{\\alpha,643},\\mathsf{Ax}_{643},\\mathsf{Rule}_{643},\\mathsf{Proof}_{643},\\vdash_{643},\\mathsf{Thm}_{643}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{ITL}_{643}=(\\mathsf{Prop},\\mathsf{Frm}_{643},\\operatorname{FV}_{643},\\operatorname{BV}_{643},\\mathsf{Subst}_{643},\\widehat\\sigma_{643},\\equiv_{\\alpha,643},\\mathsf{Ax}_{643},\\mathsf{Rule}_{643},\\mathsf{Proof}_{643},\\vdash_{643},\\mathsf{Thm}_{643}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>扩展后的完整对象为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{ITL}^{\\mathrm{sem}}_{643}\n=\n(\\mathsf{Prop},\\mathsf{Frm}_{643},\\operatorname{FV}_{643},\\operatorname{BV}_{643},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{643},\\widehat\\sigma_{643},\\equiv_{\\alpha,643},\n\\mathsf{Intv}_{643},\\mathsf{IVal}_{643},\\operatorname{Split}_{643},\\operatorname{Part}_{643},\n\\Vdash_{643},\\models_{643},\\mathsf{Val}_{643},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{643},\\mathsf{Rule}_{643},\\mathsf{Proof}_{643},\\vdash_{643},\\mathsf{Thm}_{643}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{ITL}^{\\mathrm{sem}}_{643}\n=\n(\\mathsf{Prop},\\mathsf{Frm}_{643},\\operatorname{FV}_{643},\\operatorname{BV}_{643},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{643},\\widehat\\sigma_{643},\\equiv_{\\alpha,643},\n\\mathsf{Intv}_{643},\\mathsf{IVal}_{643},\\operatorname{Split}_{643},\\operatorname{Part}_{643},\n\\Vdash_{643},\\models_{643},\\mathsf{Val}_{643},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{643},\\mathsf{Rule}_{643},\\mathsf{Proof}_{643},\\vdash_{643},\\mathsf{Thm}_{643}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统含区间估值、chop 拆分和迭代满足递归；不涉及连续时间区间版本、持续时间项或程序验证规则。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-符号表","text":"1. 符号表","level":1},{"id":"2.-公式","text":"2. 公式","level":1},{"id":"3.-自由变元","text":"3. 自由变元","level":1},{"id":"4.-命题替换","text":"4. 命题替换","level":1},{"id":"5.-公理集合","text":"5. 公理集合","level":1},{"id":"6.-推理规则关系","text":"6. 推理规则关系","level":1},{"id":"7.-证明对象","text":"7. 证明对象","level":1},{"id":"8.-可证性","text":"8. 可证性","level":1},{"id":"9.-目标区分","text":"9. 目标区分","level":1},{"id":"10.-区间结构","text":"10. 区间结构","level":1},{"id":"11.-满足关系","text":"11. 满足关系","level":1},{"id":"12.-语义后果","text":"12. 语义后果","level":1},{"id":"